cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the manuscript listed under
  "preferred-citation" (journal reference and DOI to be added when available)
  and record the release or commit used. The bundled databases contain or
  derive from the NIST/TRC ThermoML Archive (snapshot v2020-09-30); NIST asks
  that published research using ThermoML data also cite the two works listed
  under "references".
type: software
version: "v1.0.0(R)"
title: ThermoML Agents
