repository-code: https://github.com/Yunkai0825/ThermoML_research_agents_pub
url: https://github.com/Yunkai0825/ThermoML_research_agents_pub
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A local ThermoML database browser and Main, Query, and Analysis agents for
  exploring thermophysical property data, running calculations, and retaining
  reproducible session artifacts.
